e those details of the acanthus image I set up.<br /> But as the legacies The sublime cover do you rly think it fits for acanthus? They are summoning a skeleton: <a href=\"http://prntscr.com/eiisv7\" target=\"_blank\">http://prntscr.com/eiisv7</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I missed this detail. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <b>Legacy: the Sublime</b> is too much then for Acanthus wallpaper.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T13:20:08-07:00","id":1115219,"title":"","content":"Since this is my first post, I'd like to welcome all users of this forum.<br /> <br /> I'm looking for a good quality image of background graphic of Changeling: the Lost cover (here's the link: <a href=\"https://i1.wp.com/www.acrosstheboardgames.net/wp-content/uploads/changeling-the-lost-wallpaper.jpg?w=933\" target=\"_blank\">https://i1.wp.com/www.acrosstheboard...aper.jpg?w=933</a> ). I mean.. the one without subtitles, skull etc. <br /> <br /> Does anyone know if such a thing exists ? (it's not a problem for me if it would be a paid resource). <br /> <br /> Thans for any support","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13640-crisdean","name":"Crisdean","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-0